--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Spacewalker
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Upstream:  https://github.com/ConstantinSeibold/Spacewalker
Paper:     Heine et al., "Spacewalker: Traversing the Latent Space to Explore
           and Annotate Data", arXiv:2409.16793

Chevron's 3D latent walk (chevron/web/map3d.js) is ported from Spacewalker,
generalised so that a point is an instance (a mask crop) rather than only a
whole sample, and so that painting writes into Chevron's shared selection. The
persisted dimensionality reduction that lets a new query be projected into an
already-fitted space follows the same approach.

